MCQ Question Paper

Q1. Medium: In Java, how do you determine the size of an array named `list`?
A. list.size()
B. list.length()
C. list.length
D. list.count

Q2. When using the `POST` method in an HTML form, how is the data transmitted relative to the HTTP transaction?
