B. It is sent as a block within the HTTP transaction body.
C. It is encoded into the browser's cookies.
D. It is sent via a separate FTP connection.

Q3. Medium: In Java, are 'constructors' inherited by subclasses?
A. Yes, always.
B. No, never.
C. Only public constructors.
D. Only if super() is called.

